  HV.ruleEn('g4.big', 'Each <b>period</b> has 3 places: the ones period (ones, tens, hundreds), the thousands period, the millions period · <b>Value of a digit = digit × the value of its place</b> · <b>Rounding</b>: look at the digit just to the right of the rounding place — 5 or more: add 1; less than 5: keep it; the digits after it become 0.');
