  HV.ruleEn('g5.dec', 'A decimal has a <b>whole-number part</b> and a <b>decimal part</b>, separated by the decimal point (written as a comma here): 3,47 = 3 + ' + fr(4, 10) + ' + ' + fr(7, 100) + ' · To compare: whole-number parts first, then the tenths, the hundredths…');
  HV.ruleEn('g5.decops', 'Add, subtract: <b>line up the decimal points</b> · Multiply: multiply as whole numbers, then <b>count the total number of decimal places</b> to place the decimal point · Multiply (divide) by 10, 100…: move the decimal point 1, 2… places to the right (left) · <b>Dividing by a decimal</b>: move the decimal point in both numbers the same number of places to the right until the divisor is a whole number: 4,8 : 0,6 = 48 : 6 = 8.');
