  HV.ruleEn('g5.units', 'Measurements as decimals: <b>3 m 45 cm = 3,45 m</b> (because 45 cm = ' + fr(45, 100) + ' m) · <b>2 kg 50 g = 2,05 kg</b> · From a larger unit to a smaller unit, multiply: <b>1,5 tonnes = 1500 kg</b> · <b>0,25 hours = 0,25 × 60 = 15 minutes</b> · 1 m³ = 1000 dm³ · 1 ha = 10 000 m².');
  HV.ruleEn('g5.time', '<b>1 hour = 60 minutes · 1 minute = 60 seconds · 1 day = 24 hours · 1 year = 12 months</b> · Add or subtract each unit separately; 60 or more → change up, not enough → borrow · Multiply (divide) each unit, then convert: 3 hours 15 minutes × 4 = 12 hours 60 minutes = 13 hours · A leap year has 366 days.');
