  HV.ruleEn('g6.divis', 'Divisible by 2: last digit 0, 2, 4, 6, 8 · by 5: last digit 0 or 5 · by 3 (by 9): <b>the sum of the digits is divisible by 3 (by 9)</b> · by both 2 and 5: last digit 0 · A prime number is a whole number greater than 1 whose only factors are 1 and itself · <b>Prime factorisation</b>: keep dividing by 2, 3, 5, 7…: 60 = 2' + SUP(2) + ' · 3 · 5.');
  HV.ruleEn('g6.gcd', 'Using prime factors: <b>HCF = product of the common prime factors, each with its smallest index</b> · <b>LCM = product of all the prime factors (common and not common), each with its largest index</b> · Greatest number of equal shares → <b>HCF</b>; first time repeating events happen together again → <b>LCM</b>.');
