  HV.ruleEn('g8.factor', '<b>Take out a common factor</b>: AB + AC = A(B + C) · <b>Use an identity</b> · <b>Group the terms</b>, then take out a common factor · (Advanced) Split the middle term, then group: x² + 5x + 6 = x² + 2x + 3x + 6 = (x + 2)(x + 3) (two numbers with sum 5 and product 6).');
