    + 'have has had can could will would shall should may might must a an the this that these those what where when who whom whose which why how there here and or but '
    + 'so because if then than not no yes of in on at to for from with by about under behind between next near up down out over very too also please thank thanks '
    + 'hello hi goodbye bye ok okay let lets s some any much many more most less one two three four five six seven eight nine ten eleven twelve twenty hundred '
    + 'first second third every all each both little big good bad new old young happy sad mr mrs ms miss ago yesterday today tomorrow now often always usually '
